cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'teach-me: an agent-driven tutor with a verified concept map'
message: 'If you reference this project, please cite it as below.'
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Bryan
    family-names: O'Malley
    email: bryan@darkplanetgames.com
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Reithan/teach-me'
url: 'https://github.com/Reithan/teach-me'
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  teach-me turns an AI coding agent into a tutor. A planner maps the
  concepts a learning goal requires from sources the learner chooses,
  the teacher quizzes and teaches one concept at a time, and a separate
  grader agent scores each answer against the cited source. The tm CLI
  records the concept graph and every graded answer in a Mermaid file
  the learner can read.
keywords:
  - llm
  - ai-agents
  - tutoring
  - education
  - concept-map
  - mermaid
  - claude-code
version: 0.5.1
date-released: '2026-09-25'
